  "text": "Recipe: Red Lentil Bread\nCreator: Mrs N K Manku\nCategory: Bread\nIngredients: red lentils, whole psyllium husk, psyllium husk powder, baking soda, Himalayan salt, ACV (Apple Cider Vinegar)\nCooking methods: soak, blend, mix, bake\nInstructions: Soak red lentils for at least 2 hours, submerged in ample water. Then drain all the water away.\nBlend soaked red lentils & all other ingredients into a smooth batter using a mixer grinder. Transfer the batter to a bowl and mix with hands for a few minutes.\nPreheat an oven to 350F. Line a baking pan with parchment paper. Transfer the dough into the baking pan. Bake for 45 minutes.\nLet the bread cool down. Slice & serve!\nNotes: Inspired by Dr Venelina Dove's recipe at WellnessDove",
